WEBVTT

00:25:29.389 --> 00:25:30.540
they revert to tribe.

00:25:30.564 --> 00:25:32.776
And tribe seems like
community -- it's bonding.

00:25:32.800 --> 00:25:34.839
But it's really the dark
twin of community,

00:25:34.863 --> 00:25:37.499
because community is based
on mutual affection.

00:25:37.523 --> 00:25:40.684
Tribalism is based on
mutual hatred of some other.

00:25:40.708 --> 00:25:43.818
And so the tribal mentality
is always making us-them distinctions,

00:25:43.842 --> 00:25:45.104
friend-enemy distinctions.

00:25:45.128 --> 00:25:46.502
It's a scarcity mentality.

00:25:46.526 --> 00:25:48.324
"They're out to take what we've got."

00:25:48.348 --> 00:25:53.203
It's always: erect walls,
perceive threat, distrust, repel others.

00:25:53.227 --> 00:25:58.359
And to me, it comes from this loss
of any animating idea to bond us together.

00:25:58.383 --> 00:26:00.439
We started out as a country, in the US,